{"version":1,"content":"<p>巴基斯坦首都伊斯蘭馬巴德（Islamabad）郊區動物園Multi Zoo引進了10隻羊駝，遊客可以在咖啡店一邊享用飲品及小食，一邊欣賞並餵飼羊駝。</p><p>根據Multi Zoo介紹，這是巴基斯坦唯一的羊駝群，羊駝是冬眠動物，夏天為免羊駝受熱暑侵襲，園方已在牠們活動的地方安裝冷氣。</p><p>（法新社）</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T10:21:38.600831+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":144,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T08:33:29+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T07:58:12.633796+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T10:18:13.904756+00:00","content_hash":"911f1f9643f9c46eae3c6b0d8bfe6e8213e238fb5f9f9f313cd7440ba56b3e03","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}